            <span class="pd-measurement-badge">&#10003; Reference Guide</span>
          </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Informational Notice: Distinct from Basic Measurement Chart -->
        <div class="pd-measurement-notice">
          <strong>Standard Sizing Reference:</strong> Use only the product-specific reference supplied below; size labels from different systems are not interchangeable.
          <em>(Distinct from the optional downloadable <strong>Basic Measurement Chart</strong> CAD/CSV file in Digital Pattern Options, which is delivered securely after payment.)</em>
        </div>

        <div class="pd-measurement-grid">
          <!-- Left Sub-card: Measurement Size Chart Table & PDF -->
