        Select <strong>one free size</strong> for this <strong><%= product.fit || '' %> <%= product.product_type || 'Style' %></strong>. One free claim overall per email and mobile number. Contact details are not verified; this does not prevent all duplicate identities.
      </p>

      <!-- Step A: Size Selection -->
      <div style="margin-bottom:16px;">
        <label style="display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0B192C;margin-bottom:6px;">1. Choose Your Free Size</label>
